# Cloudflare Pages redirects. 301 unless noted.
#
# The secondary domain is a memorable entry point that must not become a second
# indexable copy of the site. Everything lands on the primary host.

https://njfederalbench.com/*        https://REPLACE-WITH-DOMAIN/:splat        301
https://www.njfederalbench.com/*    https://REPLACE-WITH-DOMAIN/:splat        301
https://www.REPLACE-WITH-DOMAIN/*   https://REPLACE-WITH-DOMAIN/:splat        301

# Judge URLs are slugs, and slugs change when a name is corrected. Add a line
# here rather than breaking an inbound link from a mail piece already sent.
# /judges/old-slug/  /judges/new-slug/  301
